      "chunk_id": "8d4e31c2-d911-433c-892c-fb68cb73f2db",
      "content": "Integrations\n\nNorthstar supports common data warehouse, ticketing, and workflow integrations through approved connectors and APIs. Sales Representatives should confirm exact integration support with Solutions Engineering.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002005",
      "document_id": "SALES-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "19356584-26af-4941-b6fe-9e95dea899e0",
      "content": "Product Limitations\n\nNorthstar is not a replacement for a system of record, identity provider, ERP, or clinical decision system. Sales Representatives should not promise unsupported integrations, exact roadmap delivery dates, or customer-specific contract commitments.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002005",
      "document_id": "SALES-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "071114dc-f57a-4db5-b12a-f22114a65a0c",
      "content": "Industry Use Cases\n\nFinance operations teams use Northstar to track approval delays and reconciliation exceptions. Healthcare operations teams use it to monitor non-clinical workflow bottlenecks. Logistics teams use it to track exception queues and service-level risks. Professional services teams use it to monitor delivery workflows and client reporting readiness.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002005",
      "document_id": "SALES-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "27583c5a-ba2e-4d83-b7b6-a933c0360595",
      "content": "Approved Use\n\nNorthstar systems must be used for company business, approved learning, customer support, and authorized operational work. Employees may use company devices for limited personal use if it does not interfere with work, create security risk, or violate policy.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "62cce0e9-c921-4e57-afe8-2d518cf60c29",
      "content": "NDA Rules\n\nNorthstar's standard mutual NDA may be sent to prospects, vendors, and partners by Sales Representatives or Managers after confirming the recipient's legal entity name. Non-standard NDAs, unilateral NDAs, and NDAs with unusual confidentiality periods require Legal review before signature.\n\nEmployees must not promise that Northstar will accept a customer's NDA without review. The approved talk track is: \"We can review your NDA or provide our standard mutual NDA through Legal Operations.\"",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002008",
      "document_id": "LEGAL-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    }
  ],
